{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球首艘以氫動力為核心的郵輪「維京天秤座」號日前在意大利安科納由芬坎蒂尼集團正式交付給維京遊輪。這艘船可搭載998名賓客，最受關注的能力是在靠港期間依靠氫燃料維持約10小時的電力供應，從而減少郵輪停泊時燃燒柴油帶來的污染。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588316.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.308274+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:43:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"6f61a5fabaafc78b9fd508d3b6ab333cd82ac3c649c1e5c9e20e44ed245def51","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}